 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "ChatApp() starts with no channels. createChannel(channelId) returns true, or false when it already exists. addBot(channelId, botName, botType) returns false when the channel is missing, the type is unknown or the name is already used by a bot in that channel, otherwise adds the bot and returns true. sendMessage(channelId, userId, text) returns false for a missing channel, otherwise logs and returns true. getRecentMessages(channelId, k) returns the last min(k, log size) entries of that channel, oldest first, or [] for a missing channel. Bot types (inferred, since the preview cuts them off): \"echo\" answers a message starting with \"/echo \" with the rest of the text; \"reverse\" answers a message starting with \"/reverse \" with the rest reversed; \"count\" answers the exact message \"/count\" with the number of user messages in the channel so far, including this one, in decimal. Log entries are \"<sender>: <text>\". After a user message is logged, bots react in the order they were added; bot replies are logged but never trigger bots.  Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
